WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.660
From the Temple of Hera at Olympia in Northern&nbsp;
Greece, the Olympic flame is rekindled from the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.660 --> 00:00:15.330
Sun according to tradition and from Greece it&nbsp;
starts on its journey to France and the Winter&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:15.330 --> 00:00:20.010
Olympics. At all the airports the torch&nbsp;
is carried by runners through the rain.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:23.670 --> 00:00:28.380
Pierre de Coubertin a Frenchman&nbsp;
revived the Olympics in 1896.

00:00:31.570 --> 00:00:34.330
The runners carried the torch&nbsp;
through the streets of Paris&nbsp;

00:00:48.610 --> 00:00:53.260
but before continuing on their way to the&nbsp;
Alps a ceremony at the Paris City Hall.

00:01:03.950 --> 00:01:09.470
So another Olympic year in 1968 begins&nbsp;
with the torches arrival at Grenoble&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:09.470 --> 00:01:14.720
site of the Winter Games later it&nbsp;
will be carried to Mexico City for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:14.720 --> 00:01:18.530
the second half of the world's&nbsp;
most famous athletic contest.

